      "content": "How to Sort Data?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Suppose you have a list of numbers, as shown below:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "numbers = [12, -4, 56, 67, 10]"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You can quickly sort those elements using the list's sort() method."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "1numbers = [12, -4, 56, 67, 10]\n2numbers.sort()  \n3\n4print(numbers)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "[-4, 10, 12, 56, 67]"
    },
